### 3. Card Visual Enhancements
**File**: [dashboard-dark.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard-dark.css#L570-L608)

#### Enhanced Shadows
**Before**:
```css
box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
```

**After**:
```css
box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), 
            0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
```

#### Orange Accent on Hover
Added animated orange gradient bar at top of cards:
```css
.card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6600 0%, #ff8533 50%, #ff6600 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
}

.card:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
}
```

#### Improved Hover State
- **Transform**: translateY(-6px) (increased from -4px)
- **Shadow**: Deeper, more dramatic shadow
- **Border**: Orange tint rgba(255, 102, 0, 0.2)
- **Transition**: 0.4s cubic-bezier for smooth animation

#### Typography
- **H3 Font Weight**: Increased to 600 (from 500)
- **Letter Spacing**: Added 0.02em for better readability

